      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}Thanks for the reply.\n\n- The background is not blue, so it is not Prefab editing mode.\n\n- The avatar is present in the Hierarchy.\n\nWhen I switch from the Authentication tab back to the Builder tab,\n\nthe text input becomes usable again.\n\nHowever, even after that, trying Build & Publish results in the same behavior\n\n(no build, no upload).\n\nAfter that, I tried Build & Test.\n\nFrom that point on, Unity started showing errors even on startup,\n\nand restarting Unity does not clear them.\n\nSwitching from Authentication to Builder no longer restores the state,\n\nand additional errors continue to appear.\n\nSo the Authentication → Builder workaround only fixes the UI input lock,\n\nbut does not restore the actual build/publish functionality,\n\nand the situation seems to worsen after attempting Build & Test.",
